WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
- Wait, one of the times
that we saw each other,

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.750
we were at a lunch and you were talking

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.830
about your son and how he's a musician,

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.480
you were so proud of him.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.770
'Cause there's big footsteps.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.000
- Yes, yes.
- With his father, Eddie.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.192
So, it's amazing he's
nominated for a Grammy.

00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:14.094
(Valerie shouting excitedly)

00:00:14.094 --> 00:00:16.590
Congratulations!
- Oh, thank you, thank you.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.280
I couldn't be more happy.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.900
I am so much more happy for his success

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.520
than I ever, ever could be for mine.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.353
I'm over the moon.
- [Kelly] Yeah, that's a mom.

00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:25.570
- Yeah, I guess so.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.150
- How did you get the news
that he'd been nominated?

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.330
- I didn't realize the
nominations were happening

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.267
and it was online and I went,
"Oh my god! I wanna see."

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:39.070
I saw Billie Eilish, and she
was announcing the rock group.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.380
And when they got to best song,

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.310
I screamed in the middle of
my bathroom all by myself.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.950
Scared my animals, they all
came running out of the room.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.840
But, the first person I wanted to call,

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:55.400
after Wolfie, was Ed, 'cause
Ed was beyond the moon.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.170
Proud of Wolfie, the only thing

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.450
in this world that ever
made Wolfie happy--

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.880
that ever made Ed happy,
they're the same person,

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.750
was Wolfie.
- [Kelly] Aw!

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.570
- Ed just got so much joy
out of watching Wolfie

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.803
play music and be creative.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.105
I wish he was here.

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.220
- Well, and also, 'cause it's one

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:15.700
of those things when
it's something you love

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.210
and you see, even when I see my daughter

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.010
at a school performance, I'm like--

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.420
I'm not the mom that's like,
"Make your smile, honey!"

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:25.610
I'm not that mom, but I do get excited

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:28.607
'cause it's something that
we share, so that's cool.

00:01:28.607 --> 00:01:29.440
- [Valerie] It is.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.864
- I'm so happy for him, please
tell him congratulations.

00:01:30.864 --> 00:01:33.040
- Thank you, I will.
- That's so frickin' cool.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.030
Especially songwriting, that's so cool.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.030
- 'Cause you know how hard
it is to write a song!

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.220
- It is, and it's also a hard category,

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:40.400
there's so many amazing songs
that are released in a year

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.730
and how do you pick the few
that are gonna be in that,

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:43.563
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:43.563 --> 00:01:46.353
It's a hard thing, so, congratulations.

